  "description": "Central module registry for Compound GPID — declares every canonical asset's owning module across three layers (kernel, capability packs, suites), plus dependency edges. Schema: a 'module' has id, layer (kernel|capability|suite), displayName, description, dependsOn (module ids in lower layers only), ownedAssets (glob patterns under .github/; trailing '/' means the directory and everything below it), and an optional 'ambiguous' list (each entry {asset, note}) flagging ownership decisions that must be resolved by a maintainer.",
